+//     : runtime out/classes : truffle out/classes : truffle lib/*.jar), and
+//     the suite runs exactly as that Makefile runs it (same runner class,
+//     same -Dgraalgo.repo.dir, same tmpdir discipline). Only the truffle
+//     module has a wired suite runner; a mutant in another backend module
+//     fails loudly (ERROR verdict) instead of running the wrong suite.
